const refs: `const Type &`. This change prevents making unnecessary copies of parameters when calling functions, including when the bindings call the functions.\r\n\r\nMotivation: I tried changing the copy constructors of container types like Array to explicit, but this creates a problem for non-const-ref parameters of container types in the bindings. Right now, the bindings are implicitly making copies of this data, and the bindings do not compile anymore if this is changed to explicit. See the discussions in PR #107377 and PR #110912 for more information.\r\n\r\nOnly doing this for container types would be sufficient for that purpose, but that would be a massive change throughout the entire codebase. I think it would be better for reviewability if I open multiple PRs targeting specific parts of the codebase, so for example, this PR can be reviewed by the OpenXR team. And, while I'm at it, I also made this change for types such as `String` and `Ref<>` to fix up those too.\r\n\r\nThis PR also contains a small number of other changes to parameters, such as using `p_` and `r_` consistently.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine